		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: pybullet: Synthetic Cameras default to open. Is there a way to change this behavior?]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=43354#p43354"><![CDATA[
In case someone come accross this post, but is looking for how to completely close the Explore, Test and Params tabs like I did (e.g. for recording videos):<div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>pybullet.configureDebugVisualizer(COV_ENABLE_GUI, 0)</code></pre></div>Additionally, you can also press the 'g' key to toggle.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=13892">mcres</a> — Fri Mar 19, 2021 9:41 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
