		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=40203#p40203"><![CDATA[
Can you try the COV_ENABLE_RGB_BUFFER_PREVIEW, COV_ENABLE_DEPTH_BUFFER_PREVIEW, COV_ENABLE_SEGMENTATION_MARK_PREVIEW flags<br>in configureDebugVisualizer?<br><br>enable = 0 or 1<div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>pybullet.configureDebugVisualizer(pybullet.COV_ENABLE_RGB_BUFFER_PREVIEW,enable)</code></pre></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Fri Dec 08, 2017 3:08 pm</p><hr />
